0）成交约194.13亿元（创今年1月以来天量，环比暴增，尾盘半小时大量成交）。\n科创50ETF华夏、创业板ETF易方达均突破100亿元（为8月19日以来首次）。\n沪深300系列ETF合计成交额约301.24亿元，环比大增约366%。","url":"https://x.com/zhishuzengzhang/status/2110708683097411906"},{"author_id":"1502253517737586691","created_at":"2026-10-15T01:50:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110548714125181143"],"id":"2110548714125181143","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":938,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"text":"A股大幅低开！\n\n受昨晚美国CPI超预期冲击，三大指数全线低开，创业板开盘跌幅超过3%。\n\n算力、PCB、存储芯片集体重挫，直接承接隔夜美股半导体暴跌的情绪。\n\n盘面反差：煤炭、油气等高股息板块逆势抗跌，资金开盘直接涌向防御资产避险。","url":"https://x.com/aystxdlzfhj/status/2110548714125181143"},{"author_id":"1484783062772695040","created_at":"2026-10-15T08:52:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110654943833075976"],"id":"2110654943833075976","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":70,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"沪深300ETF易方达（510310）今天成交了194亿，是今年1月28日以来最大的一天，而它整个上午只成交了6亿多。","url":"https://x.com/MartynZheng/status/2110654943833075976"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110635024404168704","3_2110635032499179520","3_2110635040761839616"]},"author_id":"1999693479178567681","created_at":"2026-10-15T07:33:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110635048198422529"],"id":"2110635048198422529","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":57,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"10月15日:\n\n上证指数收盘跌1.95%，\n深证指数收盘跌2.43%。\n\n易方达沪深300ETF\n尾盘明显放巨量，\n\n日成交额近194.1亿元，\n\n而前几日连10亿都不到。\n这种突然爆量，\n\n从量能走势看就是国家队的手法。\n\n沪深300ETF广发成交:4.48亿元\n沪深300ETF华安成交:6.37亿元\n也出现放量。 https://t.co/HSL9hUNPHz","url":"https://x.com/ZoXinkun2O26/status/2110635048198422529"},{"author_id":"1609897027709861888","created_at":"2026-10-14T06:39:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110259243064689127"],"id":"2110259243064689127","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":711,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"tex